OL,3,GNEWSA#20,000 reward offered for Glasgow
OL,4,Ashooting information                   
OL,6,FA #20,000 reward is being offered for  
OL,7,Finformation leading to an arrest and   
OL,8,Fconviction over the attempted murder of
OL,9,Fa woman who was shot in her Glasgow    
OL,10,Fhome.                                  
OL,12,FThe 27-year-old is in a critical but   
OL,13,Fstable condition in hospital following 
OL,14,Fthe incident in the Lambhill area of   
OL,15,Fthe city last Monday.                  
OL,17,FPolice said extensive inquiries        
OL,18,Fcontinue and over 100 people have been 
OL,19,Fspoken to so far.                      
