OL,4,Ashooting information                   
OL,6,FThey want to speak to anyone who saw a 
OL,7,Fgrey or silver Mitsubishi Outlander in 
OL,8,Fthe area around Eynort Street about the
OL,9,Ftime of the attack.                    
